  "interpretation": [
    "All fourteen selected comparison outputs pass geometry and paper checks; twelve pass complete candidate checks. The two bauble repeats remain fidelity failures.",
    "The short legal fallback prevented invalid exports but increased bauble observed error to about 5%. Giving the ordinary finalist its full first window keeps it around 4.38\u20134.40%, close to the 4.34\u20134.38% baseline, without claiming a new success.",
    "Prioritizing the ordinary candidate also runs on the puppy, increasing the targeted missing-corner replay to 13.5\u201314.0 seconds. It still retains 3+5 cuts and its small opening. This is not an across-the-board speedup.",
    "The affected Hunodan case retains 4+4 cuts in 5.10\u20135.13 seconds. The bird eye survives, but total disagreement remains about 2.10%, above its unperturbed 1.96% baseline.",
    "The free-border hat and house remain byte-identical. Original masks, coverage, thresholds and budgets were not changed.",
    "Candidate contact sheets were visually inspected. Puppy joins, bird frame defects and bauble crop/motif errors remain; passing geometric checks does not establish physical assembly or original cutting-path recovery."
  ],
